      <div type="clause" n="39">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 39</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[{LXXXIII}] Gif hwa fare unáliefed fram his hlaforde oððe on oðre scire hine bestele, ⁊ hine mon geahsige, fare þær he ær wæs ⁊ geselle his hlaforde LX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone moves away from his lord without permission or steals away into another shire, and he is found, let him return to where he was before and let him pay his lord 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone moves away without permission from his lord and steals into another district, if he is discovered he shall return to where he was before, and give his lord 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa fare unalyfed from his hlaforde oððe on oðre scire hine bestele, ⁊ hine mon geaxie, fare þær he wæs ær ond gesylle his hlaforde LX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
